OL,3,GNEWSATeenage soldier 'let down' after
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage soldier was "let down" by two
OL,7,Fsenior officers when she "told each of
OL,8,Fthem enough to understand that she may
OL,9,Fhave been sexually assaulted" five
OL,10,Fmonths before she took her own life, a
OL,11,Fcourt martial has heard.
OL,13,FRoyal Artillery Gunner Jaysley Beck,
OL,14,Ffrom Cumbria, was found dead in her
OL,15,Fbarracks at Larkhill Camp in Wiltshire
OL,16,Fon 15 December 2021, months after
OL,17,Fformer Battery Sgt Michael Webber
OL,18,F"pinned her down" and sexually
OL,19,Fassaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
