OL,3,GNEWSATeenage soldier 'let down' after
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough the 19-year-old reported the
OL,7,Fincident, the chain of command failed
OL,8,Fto properly deal with the case, the
OL,9,Fcourt was told.
OL,11,FMaj James Hook and Col Samantha
OL,12,FShepherd are on trial accused of
OL,13,Fconduct prejudicial to good order and
OL,14,Fservice discipline.
